# Frontend env. Read only in dev mode (`bun dev`). Gitignored as .env.
# In prod the image is built by `ctl build`, which forwards this file as build args, and the
# container gets nothing at runtime: the bundle is static and same-origin (/api via nginx in this image).
# Every key here is public. No secret, no URL, no per-environment value. Build constants only.
# The API location is NOT here. Dev: vite.config.ts proxies /api using API_PORT from the process env
# (ctl dev exports the root .env). Prod: nginx in this image proxies /api to the api container.
VITE_APP_NAME=<display name>
